    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 525274506826451584, guid: 815976abe225a8b45bd181f927c9c927, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Light & Spatial perception, Light and colored surfaces work together
        to define space. White walls reflect up to 90% of light, acting as secondary
        sources that bounce illumination back into the enivornement .


        Step
        into the follwing rooms to see how light positioning and wall reflectance
        alter spatial depth.


        Notice how the perceived room volume changes
        between setups.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
